  "question": {
    "text": "If for <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> the derivative of <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> is <math><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> , then <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> equals:"
